  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at initiate Swedish-Armenian cooperation within the forest education sector. The education intends to establish a platform for national cooperation and forestry education development to meet the current needs in Armenia. The project contains four elements: travel study to Sweden, manpower and compentence needs assessment, joint education , curriculum development.</narrative>
